layout: base.njk
title: Projects
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<h1>Projects</h1>

<p>Things built and being built — radio, Linux, microcontrollers. Each
project states its own code license on its page; the site footer's
CC&nbsp;BY-NC-SA notice covers prose, not code.</p>

{# Projects are grouped to match the about page's arc: assistive
   technology first, then data, then radio. Every project's front matter
   needs a `group` (one of the names below) and an `order` within it. #}
{% set groups = ["Assistive technology", "Data", "Amateur radio"] %}
{% set projects = collections.projects | sort(attribute="data.order") %}
{% if projects.length %}
{% for g in groups %}
{% set grouped = projects | inGroup(g) %}
{% if grouped.length %}
<h2>{{ g }}</h2>
<ul>
{% for p in grouped %}
  <li><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.title }}</a>{% if p.data.summary %} — {{ p.data.summary }}{% endif %}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
<p><em>Nothing written up yet. The bench is not empty — the write-ups
just haven't caught up.</em></p>
{% endif %}
